<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine c. bank sells dollars at 28.48 pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine c. bank sells dollars at 28.48 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank sold dollars at 28.48 pesos in early trading on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe it sold $8.0 million,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>Banks are still buying dollars to meet import requirements of clients.</p>
<p>After 90 minutes of trades, the peso traded at 28.48 from the previous close of 28.479. Volume was at $8 million.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8937</p>
</text>
